audiocfg (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build as a standalone CLI only: drop shared/static library and pkg-config.
  * Split PulseAudio helpers into src/{session,parse,catalog,select,profile}.c
    and rename the public header to src/acfg.h (no lib* source names).
  * Align with zephyr packaging: AsciiDoc man pages via asciidoctor, VERSION,
    debian/rules --builddirectory=debian/build, zfr version in Meson, and
    multi-distro packaging/ scaffolding.
  * Expand L1 gettext coverage (ar, es_MX) and unwrap .po catalogs.

